  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nsynapse ignores the app_name setting in homeserver.yaml\r\n`homeserver.yaml\r\nemail:\r\n   app_name: Matrix`\r\n\r\nsynapse/push/mailer.py:  \r\n`self.app_name = app_name\r\n...\r\nlogger.info(\"Created Mailer for app_name %s\" % app_name)`\r\n\r\nhomeserver.log: - synapse.push.mailer - 91 - INFO - - Created Mailer for app_name Riot\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- set app_name: Matrix in the email section of homeserver.yaml \r\n- activate email notification enable_notifs: True\r\n- force a email notification\r\n- check the Mail Header of the sent email\r\n\r\nI get in every case [Riot] and not [Matrix] in the email subject of the notification email.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\n- **Version**:        0.27.2-1\r\n- **Install method**: apt-get install (deb https://matrix.org/packages/debian/ jessie main)\r\n- **Platform**:  Debian 8.10\r\n",
